        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 7.2. All regular scheduled tours shall be assigned by seniority in accordance with the employees' written selection. Approval of tour selections will be contingent upon consideration of work load, requirements of telephone service and requirements of law. Work group schedules will be posted every four weeks. Employees of each work group shall be afforded opportunity to express their choice of tour changes in the week preceding the schedule posting.",
            "block_bbox": [
