        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 7.3. Employees may trade scheduled work hours with the approval of the supervisor. Approval will be contingent upon considerations of work load, service requirements, and requirement of law. Ordinarily approval will be denied if overtime results from the trade.",
